\section*{Technical Appendix}

\section{Python-based Keylogger with Process Hollowing and DLL Injection}

This section details the implementation of a stealth keylogger leveraging \texttt{pynput} for keystroke capture, combined with process hollowing and DLL injection techniques to evade antivirus detection.

\subsection{Code Structure}

\begin{itemize}
  \item \texttt{keylogger.py}: Main script capturing keystrokes via \texttt{pynput.keyboard.Listener}.
  \item \texttt{process\_hollower.py}: Implements process hollowing to inject malicious payload into a legitimate process.
  \item \texttt{dll\_injector.c}: C-based DLL injection code compiled into \texttt{inject.dll}, injected into target process after hollowing.
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Keylogger Implementation (Python)}

\begin{verbatim}
