\subsection{Process Hollowing Overview}

\begin{enumerate}
  \item Create a suspended legitimate process (e.g., \texttt{notepad.exe}) via \texttt{CreateProcess} with \texttt{CREATE\_SUSPENDED} flag.
  \item Unmap the legitimate process's memory via \texttt{NtUnmapViewOfSection}.
  \item Inject malicious executable payload into the target process address space.
  \item Adjust thread context to entry point of injected payload.
  \item Resume thread to execute injected code.
\end{enumerate}

\subsection{DLL Injection Method}

\begin{itemize}
  \item Allocate memory in target process using \texttt{VirtualAllocEx}.
  \item Write DLL path string into target process memory with \texttt{WriteProcessMemory}.
  \item Create remote thread at \texttt{LoadLibraryA} address pointing to DLL path string.
  \item Wait for remote thread completion, confirming injection.
\end{itemize}

